# Best-effort, gitignore-style patterns for graphify (not a confirmed-supported
# filename as of writing — graphify's own skill docs don't mention reading this
# file, so verify it's actually honored before relying on it).
#
# NOTE: this repo's Rust tests are inline `#[cfg(test)] mod tests { ... }`
# blocks inside production files (ao3.rs, db.rs, queries.rs), not separate
# files — a path-based ignore can't exclude just those blocks without also
# dropping the real code in the same file. Patterns below only cover
# standalone test files/dirs (none exist yet on the frontend either) and
# general build noise.

# Standalone test files/dirs (future-proofing — none exist yet)
tests/
__tests__/
*.test.ts
*.test.js
*.spec.ts
*.spec.js
*_test.rs

# Dependencies / build artifacts
node_modules/
target/
build/
.svelte-kit/
package/
dist/

# graphify's own output
graphify-out/

# Misc
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
